notes.content:
Dip your claws into cute chaos! Survive, summon, and snag the demo. Are you ready? Dive into adorable mayhem, summon your inner cultist, and join the fluffiest adventure. 

Clawed Cult Demo Features:

- Reverse bullet hell mechanics for a unique and challenging gameplay experience;
- A cute and creepy cultist cat, Shadow, with its own unique abilities and weapons;
- A Lovecraftian world filled with mysterious and ancient creatures;
- Summon under your control a GIGA FLAN for aid you into battle;
- Hordes of enemies, each with their own attack patterns and abilities;

Download our demo during the event and get ready to purr-vive!
